<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="58f2aa60">&lt;p&gt;
    Key responsibilities include:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Developing and implementing the target state solution architecture
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Working with key client stakeholders to define policies and acceptance criteria
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identifying and resolving technical gaps and issues
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Overseeing the overall integration strategy design and execution
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Overseeing the provisioning and management of test, development, and production environments
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Assisting with the design of application controls and security
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Supporting project systems environment, including full promote to production path
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Assisting the client organization with technical activities, including the following: 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Database management and systems administration
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Correction and transports
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
